    <detaileddescription>
<para>The produced states are filtered using the provided <ref refid="classIMP_1_1domino_1_1SubsetFilterTable" kindref="compound">SubsetFilterTable</ref> objects. The assignments are enumerated and filtered by recursively dividing the subset in half. </para>
